        ]
      ],
      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "d603e642349eeae7f822a7a6d8037b459cd00b1580e399cf7f88b263baf682d7"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Here $$ \\sigma(A_{d},z)=\\sigma\\Biggl(A_{d},A_{d}+\\sum_{i\\neq j}A_{s,i}+e\\Biggr)=\\sigma^{2}(A_{d})+r(n-1)\\sigma(A_{d},A_{s}) $$ while $$ \\sigma(A_{s},z)=\\sigma\\Biggl(A_{s},A_{d}+\\sum_{i\\neq j}A_{s,i}+e\\Biggr)=\\sigma(A_{d},A_{s})+r(n-1)\\sigma^{2}(A_{s}) $$",
      "source_page": 764,
      "source_pages": [
        764
      ],
      "source_block_ids": [
